# 묶음 전환: Unassigned 묶음을 둘 만들고 오가도 셸 프로세스가 그대로이고, 탭 줄은 보이는 묶음의 터미널만 보인다.
waittabs 1 @30000
send echo GROUP-ONE\r
waitline GROUP-ONE @20000
state group-one
act workadd
waittabs 2 @20000
send echo GROUP-TWO\r
waitline GROUP-TWO @20000
state group-two
shot group-two
act selectgroup 1
wait 500
state back-to-one
shot group-one
act selectgroup 2
wait 500
state back-to-two
daemonlist after-switch
quit
